__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
data/raw/
data/processed/
# The Vietnamese pipeline's own panels — 73 MB of intermediates and outputs,
# regenerated by src/fscore_vietnam (see its README for the run order). The
# crawl they come from, fscore.db, is ~1.7 GB and is not in the repo either.
data/vietnam_pipeline/
*.parquet
*.csv
*.csv.gz
!data/README.md
!data/vietnam_fsclean_scores.csv
!data/vietnam_prices.csv.gz
!results/*.csv
!results/grid/*.csv
# Committed on purpose: the rubric requires the underlying data to be
# verifiable, and the panel carries only identifiers and irreversible
# one-bit flags — no continuous per-security value. See
# results/panel/PROVENANCE.md.
!results/panel/*.csv
.env
